  "worked_solution": "We notice the following:\n\n- The horizontal component (i.e., the $i$ component) is zero for each vector in our vector field. Therefore, we can rule out the following options:\n\n$$\nF(x,y)=4\\,i,\\,K(x,y)=-3\\,i\n$$\n\n- The vertical component (i.e., the $j$ component) is negative for each vector in our vector field. Therefore, we can rule out the following option:\n\n$$\nG(x,y)=2\\,j\n$$\n\nTherefore, we conclude that the diagram corresponds to the vector field $H(x,y)=-5\\,j.$",
